    "- Missing categorical values were assigned the category `Unknown`.\n",
    "- Binary columns with fewer than 1,000 missing values were imputed using the mode.\n",
    "- Ordinal and count columns with fewer than 1,000 missing values were imputed using the rounded median.\n",
    "- Missing values in `health_insurance`, `doctor_recc_h1n1`, and `doctor_recc_seasonal` were retained."
