   "source": [
    "### Handle numeric missing values\n",
    "\n",
    "- The numeric columns are survey answers (0/1 flags or 1-5 scales), not measurements.\n",
    "- Filling them with the median would hide the missing answers inside a real group\n",
    "  (e.g. 46% missing `health_insurance` would all become \"insured\").\n",
    "- For the EDA, missing numeric answers get an explicit \"Unknown\" group, like the categorical columns.\n",
    "- Numeric imputation will be handled during modeling."
   ]
  },
