   "source": [
    "### Hypothesis 3 conclusion: Doctor recommendations → strongly supported\n",
    "\n",
    "- A **doctor's H1N1 recommendation** raises H1N1 uptake from 13.6% to 53.2% (about 4×).\n",
    "- A **doctor's seasonal recommendation** raises seasonal uptake from 34.6% to 73.8% (about 2×).\n",
    "- Each recommendation mainly increases its own vaccine, but it also raises the other one.\n",
    "- Respondents with no answer (\"Unknown\") have the lowest H1N1 uptake (8.6%).\n",
    "- **Verdict:** doctor recommendation is the strongest single factor found in this analysis."
   ]
  },
